create-font licensing map
=========================

Copyright 2026 Jeremy Banka

This repository deliberately uses different licenses at different product
boundaries. The license that applies to a file is determined by the most
specific entry below.

GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or later
-----------------------------------------------------

The create-font and create-design applications, the create-font editor UI, and
the repository-level application tooling are licensed under the GNU Affero
General Public License, version 3 or later (SPDX: AGPL-3.0-or-later):

- packages/create-font/**
- packages/create-design/**
- packages/editor/**
- scripts/**
- repository files not assigned another license below

The full license is in LICENSES/AGPL-3.0-or-later.txt. The additional output
permission in LICENSES/OUTPUT-EXCEPTION.txt applies to the AGPL-covered
software.

Mozilla Public License, version 2.0
-----------------------------------

Reusable libraries, public integration surfaces, and their Rust
implementations are licensed under the Mozilla Public License, version 2.0
(SPDX: MPL-2.0):

- crates/**
- packages/design-source/**
- packages/dprint-plugin-fea/**
- packages/fea-rs-wasm/**
- packages/font-service/**
- packages/font-source/**
- packages/preact-konva/**
- packages/server/**
- packages/source-format/**
- packages/source-rpc/**
- packages/states/**
- packages/target/**
- packages/vector-geometry/**

The full license is in LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt.

Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
-----------------------------------------------

The root README, documentation under docs/**, the workbench-poster example under
designs/workbench-poster/**, and its attribution notice at
designs/workbench-poster.ATTRIBUTION.md are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International license (SPDX: CC-BY-4.0).

The full license is in LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt.

SIL Open Font License, version 1.1
----------------------------------

The Workbench Sans example font, including its source under
fonts/workbench-sans/** and its notice at fonts/workbench-sans.OFL.txt, is
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, version 1.1 (SPDX: OFL-1.1). No
Reserved Font Name is declared.

The full license and font-specific copyright notice are in
fonts/workbench-sans.OFL.txt.

Third-party material
--------------------

Dependencies and other third-party material retain their own copyright and
license terms. Nothing in this repository's licenses grants rights that its
copyright holders do not possess.

The standard license texts in LICENSES/** and their package- or
directory-local copies are reproduced under the terms supplied by their
respective license stewards; this licensing map does not relicense those texts.
